Third-party software included in this distribution
---------------------------------------------------

This package vendors a copy of the EPAM Indigo cheminformatics toolkit
under `glyph/ocsr/_indigo/` (Python wrappers and Linux x86_64
shared libraries `lib/Linux/x64/libindigo.so`, `libindigo-renderer.so`,
`libbingo.so`, `libindigo-inchi.so`).

EPAM Indigo is Copyright (c) 2009-2026 EPAM Systems Inc., and is
distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The original
upstream project is hosted at:

    https://github.com/epam/Indigo

The EPAM Indigo source license text accompanies the original
distribution. The Apache License terms in the LICENSE file at the
root of this repository govern the redistribution of these vendored
binaries; modifications to those files (if any) are noted in
`glyph/ocsr/_indigo/`.


This package also vendors a `vocab_chars.json` token vocabulary
copied from MolNexTR (CYF200127/MolNexTR), used to seed our
character-level SMILES tokenizer for reproducibility comparisons.
The vocabulary is a list of token strings; it carries no executable
code. The MolNexTR project is published under its own license; see
the upstream repository for terms.
